  "verseCount": 35,
  "content": [
    {
      "name": "chapter",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "number": "8",
        "style": "c",
        "sid": "JDG 8"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "8",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Abamidiani bakobugwa kegima",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "1",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:1"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "1",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Abanto ba Efraimu bakabooria Gidioni, “Nase ki otatorangeretie ekero kwagendete korwania Abamidiani? Inki eke gwatokoreire?” Naende bakamwomania, bare n’obotindi obonge mono.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.1"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ere akabairaneria, “Ngento ki nakorire inche kegwekaine eki mwakorire inwe? Inee! Ogochoora kw’amasabibu amatigari kw’Abaefraimu tikori okuya kobua rigesa ri’emesabibu n’abanto b’Abieseri?",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nyasae obeekire Orebu na Seebu, abagaambi b’Abamidiani, ase amaboko aino. Inche ’ngento ki nakorire kegwekaine eki mwakorire inwe?” Ekero baigwete aya Gidioni akwanete, endamwamu yabo y’okomobea egakenda.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.3"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono Gidioni amo n’abanto baye amagana atato bagaacha Yorodani, bakaamboka. Nonya konya bagoyire, bakagenderera kobwatia ababisa babo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidioni agateebia abanto ba Sukoti, “Komoranche moe abanto aba bagontunyana emegati. Barabwo bagoyire, nainche ’nkobwatia inde Seba na Salimuna, abarwoti b’Abamidiani, mbarwanie.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "6",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:6"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "6",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Korende abatang’ani ba Sukoti bagateeba, “Naki rende torakore tobae abarwani bao emegati? Naye torabua Seba na Salimuna.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.6",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.6"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "7",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:7"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "7",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidioni akairaneria, “Ekero Omonene arabeeke Seba na Salimuna ase amaboko ane, ning’arie chinyama chi’emebere yaino n’amagwa y’orosana na amageri.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.7",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.7"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "8",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:8"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Gidioni agatiga Sukoti, akageenda gochia Penueli na agwo akabooria abanto amang’ana aria aria, korende abanto ba Penueli bakamoiraneria buna abanto ba Sukoti bamoiraneretie.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.8",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.8"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "9",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:9"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "9",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ase igo akabateebia, “Ekero ’ndachiche naende inde n’obobui, nintagore omoorobiri oyo.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.9",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.9"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "10",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:10"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "10",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Bono Seba na Salimuna nigo barenge agwo Karikori amo n’abarwani babo chilifu ikomi na isano. Ase abarwani ba moocha nabwo boka batigarete. Abarwani chilifu rigana erimo, na merongo ebere, abarwanete n’emioro, konya baitirwe.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.10",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.10"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "11",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:11"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "11",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidioni agatiirera enchera abagendi banarete goeta, moocha ya Noba na Yogibea, akaumokera omoganda bw’abarwani ekero orenge n’obotoereru.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.11",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.11"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "12",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:12"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "12",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Seba na Salimuna, abarwoti baria babere b’Abamidiani, bagatama, korende Gidioni akababwatia goika akababeeka biara. Erio akagosa abarwani bonsi na kobaserebania.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.12",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.12"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "13",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:13"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Ekero Gidioni, mosinto o Yoashi, airanete korwa ase esegi agaetera ebitirimboko bia Heresi,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "akabwata omomura omosae oyomo o Sukoti, akamoboora‐booria amang’ana, omomura oyio akamoriikera amarieta y’ abanto abanene, na abagaaka ba Sukoti, emerongo etano n’ebere, na batano na babere.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Gidioni akageenda ase abanto ba Sukoti, akabateebia, “Rora aiga Seba na Salimuna, baria inwe mwanyomaneretie mogoteeba iga: Torabua Seba na Salimuna. Naki rende torakore toe abarwani bao, abwo bagoyire, emegati!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Akaimokia amagwa y’orosana na amageri akabaaria abagaaka b’omochie oria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "17",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:17"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "17",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio agataagora omoorobiri agwo Penueli, na agaita abasacha b’omochie oria.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.17",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.17"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "18",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:18"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "18",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Gidioni akabooria Seba na Salimuna, “Inee! Abanto baria mwaitete agwo Tabori, ’nkieni ki barenge?”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Bakamoiraneria, “Kera oyomo obo nigo akogwekaine. Nigo barorekanete buna bare abana b’omorwoti.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.18",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.18"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "19",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:19"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "19",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidioni akabateebia, “Baria nigo barenge bamura baminto, abamura ba baba. Amaene, buna Omonene are moyo, onye ’mwabatigete babe moyo, inche nanga tinabaita inwe!”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.19",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.19"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "20",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:20"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "20",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende agateebia Yeteri, omwana oye omomura omotangi, “Imoka, obaite!” Korende omwana oyio tang’usa omoyio oye o birende, ekiagera nigo arenge omosae omoke.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.20",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.20"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "21",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:21"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "21",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Erio Seba na Salimuna bagateebia Gidioni, “Imoka aye omonyene, otoite, ekiagera buna omonto are, naboigo ne chinguru chiaye chire.” Ere akaimoka, agaita Seba na Salimuna; akarusia chisonoi chi’ogwechabera chiarenge ase amagoti ye’chingamia chiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.21",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.21"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "22",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:22"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "22",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ayio Abaisraeli bagateebia Gidioni, “Gwatobooririe korwa ase amaboko y’Abamidiani; ase ayio kabe omogambi oito; na magega yao omwana oo na omochokoro oo ’nabatogambere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.22",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.22"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "23",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:23"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "23",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidioni akabairaneria, “Inche tinkobagambera, gose omwana one takobagambera; Omonene nere orabagaambere.”",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.23",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.23"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "24",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:24"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "24",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naende akabateebia, “Nkobasaba ’nde egento ekemo: Kera omonto ase more ang’e ebigera bire ase amato aye, biria asakorete.” (Abamidiani nigo babegete ebigera bie chitaabu, ekiagera n’Abaisumaeli barenge.)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.24",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.24"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "25",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:25"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "25",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Barabwo bakamoiraneria, “Twanchire gokobia.” Erio bakaara egetambaa inse, na ase egetambaa ekio kera oyomo akabeeka ebigera biaye bi’amato ebio basakorete.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.25",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.25"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "26",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:26"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "26",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Oborito bw’e’bigera biria asabeete aegwe nigo bwarenge koreng’ana chikiiro emerongo ebere. Amo n’ebio akaira chisonoi, n’ebigera, ne chianga chimonyinga, ebinto abarwoti b’Abamidiani barenge kobeeka, amo ne chisonoi chiria chiarenge ase amagoti ye’chingamia chiabo.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.26",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.26"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "27",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:27"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "27",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidioni akaroisia egesibao ki’obokuani korwa ase chitaabu chiria, agakebeeka ase omochie oye bw’Ofura; n’Abaisraeli bonsi bagatiga koba abegenwa ase Omonene, bagasasiima egesibao keria. Kerokio gekaba kegotega Gidioni amo n’eamate yaye.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.27",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.27"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "28",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:28"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "28",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Nabo Abamidiani babuetwe n’Abaisraeli, na tibanyaara koimoka gokora kende. Na bono ense eria ekaba n’omorembe ase engaki y’emiaka emerongo ene, goika Gidioni agakwa.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.28",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.28"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "s"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "text": "Ogokwa kwa Gidioni",
          "type": "text"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "29",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:29"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Yerubi‐Baali, mosinto o Yoashi, akairana ’nka, akamenya ase enyomba yaye omonyene.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.29"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "30",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:30"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "30",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidioni oyio nigo abwate abana abamura emerongo etano na babere, ekiagera nigo abwate abakungu abange.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.30",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.30"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "31",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:31"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "31",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Naboigo nabwate omokungu o sere-sere, oyi’omenyete Sekemu; nere akamoiborera omwana omomura, na Gidioni akamoroka Abimeleki.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.31",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.31"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "32",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:32"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "32",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Gidioni, mosinto o Yoashi, agakwa ore n’obogotu obuya, agatindekwa ase embeera ya Yoashi ise yarenge agwo omochie bw’egesaku ki’Abieseri bw’Ofura.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.32",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.32"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "33",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:33"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "33",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Magega y’ogokwa kwa Gidioni, Abaisraeli bagatiga koba abegenwa ase Omonene, na bagasasiima chinyasae chiria Baali. Bagachoora Baali‐Beriti ekaba enyasae yabo,",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.33",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.33"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "34",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:34"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "34",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "bakeba Omonene, Nyasae obo, oy’obatooretie korwa ase amaboko ’ababisa baabo baabaetanaine.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.34",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.34"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "35",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "JDG 8:35"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "35",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Tibakorerete abanto b’eamate ya Yerubi‐Baali (nere Gidioni) amaya, ase okoiraneria ng’a mbuya mono ase amaya onsi abakorerete Abaisraeli.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.8.35",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.8.35"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    }
